WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.771
Think of the executive and assistant as a working

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:08.560
partnership The executive sets the business direction The assistant

00:00:08.573 --> 00:00:12.310
turns that direction into organised dependable support

00:00:13.193 --> 00:00:15.496
The two work products named on screen are your

00:00:15.561 --> 00:00:19.653
destination a working agreement and a priority decision brief

00:00:20.548 --> 00:00:22.864
You will build them through the unit rather than

00:00:22.877 --> 00:00:24.048
just read about them

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:29.335
Meridian and its people are fictional Practise making reasons

00:00:29.348 --> 00:00:34.177
visible checking uncertainty and asking the right person A

00:00:34.243 --> 00:00:37.203
course example does not give you workplace authority
